-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003241_280736640614427_2079450943404390005_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4qY_jLlCLzwQ7kNvwGf25-W&_nc_oc=AdndkTM7lXKOdS6K4CGIyxBVjSbnnA_sSagEdXxxX0eaU7bmJnm_3DtSfZk5Y9rHV5A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyyGoO6BTrpRuplrXgGex9MYnpBcS5aQml1SNtbLYr8lg&oe=69B01575"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_5.png", "id": "697956894520220", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031440_697956901186886_5235259129555712544_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qj9JsQz0LyAQ7kNvwG_nFD9&_nc_oc=Adnm-fg-SORZCAC-3gRiu02fdmZPDKf0QdCkqrD4pv6l_QFS_A0AFIhKUq9qMwu54_s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz2qzrZIIYzOg8EO0xWpKGFaHn8zltwuuv0Q9BD6s_IHw&oe=69B00944"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover_Querformat.png", "id": "4779750352059112", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035406_4779750362059111_808409654242061204_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ihbSVW1IgRoQ7kNvwEtiq7c&_nc_oc=Adl-rFUOdUVQAqD9_2K0BmGeE_svkKDDRtmkKb92FLsCp0xTNXdOLYAlswZMgjMj4Cc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afzv6Fi6J9870veiS9NnL3ZMljXzsPEPGnzUc5DMUdFaJg&oe=69AFFCBE"}, "display_name": "Virtual Kitchen", "keywords": [], "long_description": "To make the training of the 110 apprentices of the KWP (Consortium of Viennese Retirement Homes) as modern and varied as possible, we developed a VR application around the topic of \u201cmeat\u201d: Where does it come from? How is it processed? And above all: What does responsible handling of this food look like? After all, a schnitzel \u201cdoesn\u2019t come into the world vacuum-packed in the supermarket,\u201d as KWP chef Peter Haidbauer sums it up in our case video.\n\n", "short_description": "Bon appetite! We bring apprentice chefs into the virtual kitchen to teach them how to responsibly handle meat."}]}, "developer_name": "Junge R\u00f6mer"